    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764880/extras/05cdf9401fcfe27d2d24ca68a74ace91.avif?t=1752095315\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lost cat leads to an unexpected connection\u2026 and maybe something more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you meet Naomie, she\u2019s on a mission to find her runaway cat. You offer to help, not knowing this small act of kindness will lead to a heartfelt and slightly flirty adventure. What begins as a simple search turns into something deeper, filled with quiet moments, playful teasing, and growing sparks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek &amp; Seduce: Naomie</strong> is a short and rich experience that combines cozy romance with light puzzle gameplay. Each scene invites you to explore beautifully illustrated environments and find\u00a0 hidden objects, a playful touch that unlocks new, exclusive artwork of Naomie as your bond deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every hidden find, you not only get closer to her cat\u2026 but to her body.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a charming single-path narrative with flirty dialogue and feel-good vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search each level for hidden objects to unlock special images and glimpses of Naomie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxing pace, gentle humor, and a romance that stays sweet but a little spicy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, all it takes is a lost cat to help you find something worth holding on to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764880/extras/b92bab77291dfa95577afa0cd79d9a79.avif?t=1752095315\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764880/extras/a079a6a7944b2d02e30844acf25ba62f.avif?t=1752095315\" data-has-big width=800 height=1400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naomie is anything but ordinary. With short, fiery red hair, striking orange eyes, and a pair of playful cat ears perched atop her head, she\u2019s the kind of girl who turns heads without even trying. Her bold personality matches her confident look, sharp-witted, and full of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent and spirited, Naomie doesn't back down from a challenge (especially when it involves tracking down her mischievous cat). Beneath her fierce exterior, though, there's a softer, more playful side, especially when she starts to let her guard down around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, unpredictable, and full of spark, Naomie is the heart of the story and the kind of girl who keeps you on your toes from the first moment you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
